    "body": "## SHARED VISIBILITY UPDATE — MATHEMATICS RESTORE INDEX\n\nOWNER directive: make the mathematics learning visible/reusable to all later ZORR chats.\n\nBRANCH = `research/zorr-studio-mathematics-r01`\nCOMMIT = `5abb95c8d0496de8114149aa1f9f581ec934bbef`\nINDEX = `docs/research/studio-mathematics/README.md`\nMAIN_MUTATION = NO\nMERGE = NO\nCANON_LOCK = NO\n\nThe mathematics README is now the shared discovery/restore entrypoint after the mandatory `CURRENT MAIN -> CONSTITUTION -> AGENTS -> #222` boot sequence.\n\nIt now exposes the perspective priority path:\n- `MATHEMATICAL_WORLD_PERSPECTIVE_LEARNING_R01.md`\n- `PERSPECTIVE_GEOMETRY_MASTER_R01.md`\n- `code/zorr_perspective_master_r01.py`\n\nAnd establishes the ongoing visibility contract for significant math slices:\n1. persist research doc/code on the math branch;\n2. update the README when restore map/priority changes;\n3. record exact HEAD + files + PASS/NOT-PROVEN boundary in #222;\n4. no chat-only terminal knowledge;\n5. no main mutation / merge / canon lock without separate authority.\n\nThe README remains a discovery index, not a competing source of truth; exact branch files/HEAD + current tracker + current main authority prevail.",
